SUMMARY:Palm Reading Class with Fairlight
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nPalm Reading Class for Healing\, Growth a
 nd Alignment\n“Are You a Channel?”https://youtu.be/totjNeDWDD4\n\nThis
  unique approach to palm reading will teach you to identify:\n\\- psychic/
 spiritual abilities\n\\- natural gifts\n\\- aspects of individual destiny\
 n\\- trauma\n\\- challenges\n\\- energy blocks\n\nLearn ways to utilize th
 is knowledge and understanding for personal growth and living your most au
 thentic\, sovereign life.\n\nThis class will not teach you to predict the 
 future\; rather to utilize knowledge of the present to make informed choic
 es that will align you with your most desired timelines and destiny.\n\nDe
 monstration readings will be presented throughout with in-person volunteer
 s.\nQ & A session will be at the end\, time permitting.\n\nClasses will be
  held at:\nEnergetic Experiences\n81 Weaverville Rd Suite 2\, Asheville\, 
 NC 28804\nWednesday\, May 20th from 5pm-7pm.\nTickets are $35 and availabl
 e for up to 20 people to attend per class.\n\nFor questions or more inform
 ation\, please contact Fairlight via text or email at: (828) 367-9693 or a
 iryfairytarot@gmail.com\n\nMay 20th sign up link: https://calendly.com/air
 yfairytarot/palm-reading-class-for-healing-growth-and-alig-may20
